{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"pp-bank-problems-of-barter","kind":"bank","title":{"en":[{"text":"Problems of Barter"}],"zh":[{"text":"以物易物的問題"}]},"instructions":{"en":[],"zh":[]},"fonts":{"latin":"Times New Roman","eastAsia":"PMingLiU"},"pageSetup":{"paper":"A4","orientation":"portrait","margins":{"top":1296,"right":1296,"bottom":1440,"left":1296}},"header":{"enabled":false,"rule":false,"showOnFirstPage":true,"bands":[]},"footer":{"enabled":false,"rule":false,"showOnFirstPage":true,"bands":[]},"questions":[{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q59","type":"mcq","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q59-s-1","text":{"en":[{"text":"Which of the following descriptions about barter is "},{"text":"FALSE","bold":true},{"text":"?"}],"zh":[{"text":"以下哪一項關於「實物交易」的描述是錯誤的？"}]}}],"marks":1,"options":[{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q59-a","text":{"en":[{"text":"Barter means a direct exchange of goods and services."}],"zh":[{"text":"實物交易指直接以物易物。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q59-b","text":{"en":[{"text":"Barter is possible only when there is double coincidence of wants."}],"zh":[{"text":"只有當雙方的需求有雙重巧合時才能出現實物交易。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q59-c","text":{"en":[{"text":"Barter exists only in societies without a medium of exchange."}],"zh":[{"text":"實物交易只存在於沒有交易媒介的社會裡。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1992_P2_Q59-d","text":{"en":[{"text":"Usually it is more difficult to practise barter in international trade than in domestic trade."}],"zh":[{"text":"以實物交易方式進行國際貿易通常較進行本土貿易為困難。"}]}}],"answerIndex":2,"tags":["H.money","CE1992/P2/Q59"],"provenance":{"en":[{"text":"HKCEE 1992 Paper 2 Q59"}],"zh":[{"text":"香港中學會考 1992 卷二 第 59 題"}]},"lineage":{"rootId":"pp:CE1992/P2/Q59"}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q50","type":"mcq","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q50-s-1","text":{"en":[{"text":"Exchange with the use of money differs from barter exchange in that the former"}],"zh":[{"text":"利用貨幣進行交易跟以物易物不同之處在於前者"}]}}],"marks":1,"options":[{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q50-a","text":{"en":[{"text":"is controlled by the government but the latter is not."}],"zh":[{"text":"被政府控制，但後者則不是。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q50-b","text":{"en":[{"text":"has a price for each good but the latter has not."}],"zh":[{"text":"每一物品都有一價格，但後者則不是。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q50-c","text":{"en":[{"text":"does not require the double coincidence of wants but the latter does."}],"zh":[{"text":"不須雙方的需求偶合，但後者則須。"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE1995_P2_Q50-d","text":{"en":[{"text":"involves competition but the latter does not."}],"zh":[{"text":"牽涉競爭，但後者則不會。"}]}}],"answerIndex":2,"tags":["H.money","CE1995/P2/Q50"],"provenance":{"en":[{"text":"HKCEE 1995 Paper 2 Q50"}],"zh":[{"text":"香港中學會考 1995 卷二 第 50 題"}]},"lineage":{"rootId":"pp:CE1995/P2/Q50"}},{"id":"pp-CE2004_P2_Q35","type":"mcq","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","id":"pp-CE2004_P2_Q35-s-1","text":{"en":[{"text":"When a barter economy changes to an economy that uses money in exchange,"}],"zh":[{"text":"當「以物易物」的經濟轉變為「在交易中使用貨幣」的經濟，人們會"}]}}],"marks":1,"options":[{"id":"pp-CE2004_P2_Q35-a","text":{"en":[{"text":"(1) and (2) only"}],"zh":[{"text":"只有 (1) 和 (2)"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE2004_P2_Q35-b","text":{"en":[{"text":"(1) and (3) only"}],"zh":[{"text":"只有 (1) 和 (3)"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE2004_P2_Q35-c","text":{"en":[{"text":"(2) and (3) only"}],"zh":[{"text":"只有 (2) 和 (3)"}]}},{"id":"pp-CE2004_P2_Q35-d","text":{"en":[{"text":"(1), (2) and (3)"}],"zh":[{"text":"(1)、(2)、(3)"}]}}],"answerIndex":0,"statements":[{"en":[{"text":"finding trading partners becomes easier."}],"zh":[{"text":"較為容易尋獲交易對象。"}]},{"en":[{"text":"making transactions involving future settlement of debt becomes easier."}],"zh":[{"text":"較為容易達成在未來結賬的交易。"}]},{"en":[{"text":"agreeing upon prices takes a longer time."}],"zh":[{"text":"花費更多時間達致買賣雙方都同意的價格。"}]}],"tags":["H.money","CE2004/P2/Q35"],"provenance":{"en":[{"text":"HKCEE 2004 Paper 2 Q35"}],"zh":[{"text":"香港中學會考 2004 卷二 第 35 題"}]},"lineage":{"rootId":"pp:CE2004/P2/Q35"}},{"id":"pp-CE2008_P2_Q34","type":"mcq","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","id":"pp-CE2008_P2_Q34-s-1","text":{"en":[{"text":"An economy that change